lemma mergeφ (hi:i < n)(u:Fin m→I): (uP Ψ) i m u= Tx (((uP Ψ)) (i+1) m u):=by unfold pathK; rw [Depth.route Aim _ hi]; have hx : (Aim).block i= Massive.transfer (A.flight i) K (Massive.Scheme.sides_next Qv (B.n k) i) (V (i+1)) (W i):= rfl; rw [hx]; exact transit_shift ..
